<<<
fluvial, fluviatile. There is no difference in meaning, & no reason why both should exist; fluvial is recommended, even if the longer form is slightly commoner. See LONG VARIANTS.
===
**fluvial, fluviatile.** There is no difference in meaning, & no reason why both should exist; *fluvial* is recommended, even if the longer form is slightly commoner. See ^^LONG VARIANTS^^.
>>>

