**2.** The verb is liable to loose application, as in: *At one moment it seemed to be quite near, & at the next far away; for the ears, unaided by the eyes, can but imperfectly focus sound or measure its distance.* The f. of a sound being ' the point or space towards which the sound-waves converge ' (OED), ears cannot f. sound
